WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.467 --> 00:00:02.301
[pounding at door]

00:00:02.334 --> 00:00:05.738
- IT'S YOUR LANDLORD!
[pounding continues]

00:00:05.771 --> 00:00:07.740
- HEY, DEVON.

00:00:07.773 --> 00:00:09.776
- HEY, HOW YOU DOING, BROTHER?

00:00:09.809 --> 00:00:10.810
HOW YOU DOING?
YEAH.

00:00:10.843 --> 00:00:14.047
JUST, UH, STOPPING BY.

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:17.317
JUST WANTED TO CHECK UP
ON EVERYTHING.

00:00:19.218 --> 00:00:21.120
- OKAY.
- YEAH--AHA!

00:00:21.153 --> 00:00:24.090
YOU IN HERE,
YOU LITTLE MOTHER[bleep]?

00:00:24.123 --> 00:00:26.092
NOPE.

00:00:26.125 --> 00:00:29.595
CLOSET LOOK GOOD.

00:00:29.628 --> 00:00:31.664
DOOR IS STRONG.

00:00:31.697 --> 00:00:33.833
SO Y'ALL SETTLING IN?
- YEAH.

00:00:33.866 --> 00:00:37.537
WE'VE BEEN LIVING HERE
A YEAR AND A HALF, SO WE HAVE.

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:41.507
- SO, UH, HOW ARE THESE
CUPBOARDS WORKING OUT FOR YOU?

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:44.077
MAN, NOBODY IN HERE...

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:45.678
BESIDES YOUR STUFF,
WHICH LOOKS GOOD.

00:00:45.711 --> 00:00:47.413
- THANK YOU.

00:00:47.446 --> 00:00:49.715
- COMPLETELY UNRELATED--

00:00:49.748 --> 00:00:53.352
HAVE Y'ALL SEEN A 4'11" DUDE
WITH A PURPLE BEARD UP IN HERE?

00:00:53.385 --> 00:00:54.487
- NO. NO.

00:00:54.520 --> 00:00:57.156
NO, NO ONE'S IN HERE...

00:00:57.189 --> 00:00:59.292
PROBABLY BECAUSE WE LOCK
THE DOOR.

00:00:59.325 --> 00:01:03.596
- OH, HE GOT THE BODY
LIKE A RAT.

00:01:03.629 --> 00:01:06.432
HE CAN JUST SQUEEZE
THROUGH THE VENTS.

00:01:06.465 --> 00:01:08.301
- YEAH.

00:01:08.334 --> 00:01:10.136
SO YOU THINK SOMEBODY'S HIDING
IN MY APARTMENT?

00:01:10.169 --> 00:01:11.170
- NO.

00:01:11.203 --> 00:01:13.139
I TOLD YOU--

00:01:13.172 --> 00:01:14.540
IT'S JUST A SOCIAL CALL.

00:01:14.573 --> 00:01:16.309
I MEAN, WHY WOULD GERALD BE
IN HERE, ANYWAY?

00:01:16.342 --> 00:01:17.610
- GERALD.

00:01:17.643 --> 00:01:20.313
THERE IS A MAN
WITH A PURPLE BEARD

00:01:20.346 --> 00:01:22.181
NAMED GERALD IN MY APARTMENT?

00:01:22.214 --> 00:01:23.416
- HELL, NO!

00:01:23.449 --> 00:01:25.451
WHY?
DID YOU SEE HIM?

00:01:25.484 --> 00:01:27.120
HE ABOUT 4'9",
GOT A PURPLE BEARD.

00:01:27.153 --> 00:01:28.354
- YEAH.

00:01:28.387 --> 00:01:30.156
- HEY, BABY--
- [screams maniacally]

00:01:30.189 --> 00:01:31.124
- [screams]
- UGH!

00:01:31.157 --> 00:01:32.658
THIS IS--AGH!

00:01:32.691 --> 00:01:35.161
[grunts]

00:01:35.194 --> 00:01:36.662
OH.
[laughs]

00:01:36.695 --> 00:01:38.598
HEY, BABY GIRL.

00:01:38.631 --> 00:01:41.400
YOU AIN'T GERALD.
[snickers]

00:01:41.433 --> 00:01:44.570
OH, BY THE BY, HAVE YOU SEEN
A 4'5" PURPLE BEARD?

00:01:44.603 --> 00:01:45.872
- BABY...

00:01:45.905 --> 00:01:48.241
- DEVON, WHAT'S GOING ON?

00:01:48.274 --> 00:01:51.377
- OKAY, YOU KNOW,
I'M GONNA LEVEL WITH ALL Y'ALL.

00:01:51.410 --> 00:01:54.780
THERE IS A 4'3" [bleep]
WITH A PURPLE BEARD NAMED GERALD

00:01:54.813 --> 00:01:56.849
SOMEWHERE IN THIS BUILDING.

00:01:56.882 --> 00:01:58.484
- WHY DOES HE KEEP GETTING
SMALLER

00:01:58.517 --> 00:01:59.852
EVERY TIME YOU MENTION HIM?

00:01:59.885 --> 00:02:01.320
- SERIOUSLY?

00:02:01.353 --> 00:02:02.588
'CAUSE I DIDN'T WANT
TO ALARM Y'ALL.

00:02:02.621 --> 00:02:05.725
HE IS DISTURBINGLY SMALL,
REALLY.

00:02:05.758 --> 00:02:07.193
HE A GOOD GUY.

00:02:07.226 --> 00:02:08.895
HE SMOKE ROCK, THOUGH.

00:02:08.928 --> 00:02:13.232
I MEAN, HE'LL DO ANYTHING
TO GET MONEY FOR CRACK.

00:02:13.265 --> 00:02:14.734
ANYTHING.

00:02:14.767 --> 00:02:16.936
- OKAY.

00:02:16.969 --> 00:02:18.704
- I MEAN ANYTHING.

00:02:18.737 --> 00:02:20.439
- I GET IT.

00:02:20.472 --> 00:02:25.478
- HE WILL MURDER YOU.

00:02:25.511 --> 00:02:29.248
- WELL, WE CERTAINLY HOPE
YOU FIND HIM.

00:02:29.281 --> 00:02:31.484
- OH, I'M GONNA FIND HIM.

00:02:31.517 --> 00:02:33.186
DON'T WORRY ABOUT THAT,

00:02:33.219 --> 00:02:35.288
'CAUSE I'M GONNA LOOK LOW,

00:02:35.321 --> 00:02:37.290
AND THEN
I'M GONNA LOOK HIGH.

00:02:37.323 --> 00:02:40.293
[grunting]

00:02:40.326 --> 00:02:41.627
- [screams]

00:02:41.660 --> 00:02:44.730
[both screaming]

00:02:44.763 --> 00:02:47.767
- GERALD,
YOU TINY LITTLE BITCH!

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:49.802
SORRY FOR THE INCONVENIENCE,
Y'ALL.

00:02:49.835 --> 00:02:51.437
GERALD, WHEN I GET MY HANDS
ON YOU, YOU GONNA BE 2'3"!

